--TEST--
`#[Core\Router\Target]` on a `string` parameter is `E0899`: a route is a `callable` — `rule:routing/a-route-target-parameter-is-checked-like-a-link`
--FILE--
<?nvs
class Menu {
    // The route is passed as a method reference, which is a `callable`.
    public static function entry(#[Core\Router\Target] string $route): string {
        return $route;
    }
}

echo "unreachable\n";
